# Generated by the miner + server at runtime
data/manifest.json
data/manifest.js
data/http-cache.json
data/*.log
data/agent-prompt-*.md
data/agent-report-*.md
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Session handoffs and harvests: development notes with no runtime role.
# `omarchy plugin add` clones this repository onto the user's disk, so anything
# tracked here ships to every user — four of these were, including a harvest
# that reproduced the removed agent-allocation code in full. They stay on the
# author's disk and out of the plugin.
handoffs/

# Instrument output, design briefs and the clip pipeline, for the same reason,
# extended past handoffs/ on 2026-09-10. A fresh clone was 8.2MB, of which
# reports/ alone was 2.6MB — larger than everything the plugin needs to run.
# Two of these documents described a capability in the present tense that had
# been removed four commits earlier, to the reviewer auditing the repository;
# three fetched a web font from a CDN the README says we never touch.
# Reasoning and the per-artifact calls:
# docs/decisions/0003-what-ships-in-the-plugin-clone.md
# Anything genuinely meant to ship gets `git add -f` and a line in that file.
reports/
docs/2026-09-07-omarchy-packaging.html
docs/body.html
tools/reel/
